# Chimil, the Inner Sun: "Spells you control can't be countered" (you, not the opponent). Turn 3: Bot1 casts Chimil with all
# six Moxes, and at its end step Chimil's discover 5 reveals Counterspell, which has no spell to target and so goes to hand.
